      "sourceText": "For example: Remi wants to Upgrade her Top-Heavy Axe Common Weapon with the Master Work Item Upgrade but her War Axe Mundane Weapon is already Upgraded with the last available Master Work upgrade. (Her fellow party members have greedily used them all.) She will have to pay the 30 Gold to transfer Master Work from the War Axe to the Top-Heavy Axe.",
